<title>UK: Sueddeutsche Boden sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Sueddeutsche Boden sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDDEUTSCHE BODENCREDITBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.125     MATURITY  **07.MAY.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE    07.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    MUNICH    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	UNTIL 07.MAY.97, THEN STEPS UP TO 4.75 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		CALLED AT PAR. OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES K435</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
